      "rootPlaceId": 9872472334,
      "name": "[1.5x 🎃HLWN] Evade ",
      "description": "🎃 The Halloween Event is out! Collect Wisps and Spellbooks to purchase exclusive themed items!\n📜 New Weekly missions that grant exotic items and currencies!\n🎟️New Voucher currency, use it for quick revives and respawns\n🖥️ Newly Revamped Shop, Battlepass, Settings, and Community UI\n🛠️New Deployable and Utility upgrades, enhance your items with tokens and xp!\n💿 Find collectables to unlock hidden lore\n\n\n🔧 We've rewritten the codebase for better stability and optimization\n\nAction parkour game, where movement is the key to success in surviving the Nextbots.\n\n⚠️Using exploits, fastflags, or any other forms of cheats will result in an unappealable ban ⚠️\n\n⚠️You may experience flashing lights and loud sounds in-game\n❓To play, join Evade and press the \"Play\" button. To exit, press [M] or click on the \"Menu\" button in-game\n\n[E] - Interact\n[G] - Emote\n[1/3/F] - Equip item\n[2] - Usables Menu\n[C/Ctrl] - Crouch\n[T] - Whistle\n[M] - Menu\n[N] - VIP Menu",
